{'symbol': 'ADM', 'date': '2022-04-07 09:00:00', 'title': 'ADM NAMES VIKRAM LUTHAR CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ADM (NYSE: ADM), A GLOBAL LEADER IN SUSTAINABLE HUMAN AND ANIMAL NUTRITION, AND ONE OF THE WORLD'S PREMIER AGRICULTURAL ORIGINATION AND PROCESSING COMPANIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED VIKRAM LUTHAR HAS BEEN APPOINTED CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, FOLLOWING A THOROUGH SUCCESSION PLANNING AND CANDIDATE REVIEW PROCESS. LUTHAR SUCCEEDS RAY G. YOUNG, WHO HAS SERVED AS CFO SINCE 2010 AND HAS ALSO SERVED AS THE COMPANY'S VICE CHAIRMAN SINCE FEBRUARY. “VIKRAM HAS A DEEP UNDERSTANDING OF ADM'"}